---
/**
 * privacy-policy.astro — 隐私政策
 *
 * 内容按本站实际实现写，不套通用模板：
 *   表单字段取自 components/InquiryForm.astro；分析取自 BaseLayout 的 GA4；
 *   托管与日志取自 Cloudflare Workers；提交通道是 web3forms。
 * 不声明「我们不出售数据」之外的额外承诺，也不虚构保留期限 —— 保留期取决于
 * web3forms 账号设置，所以这里写成「在我们（及 web3forms）账号中留存」的口径。
 *
 * ⚠️ 本文件由代码事实整理而成，不构成法律意见；正式对外使用前应请法务/律师复核。
 */
import DocPage from "../layouts/DocPage.astro";
import { companyFacts } from "../lib/companyProfile";
---

<DocPage
    pageTitle="Privacy Policy"
    description="How MEIYU Aluminum collects, uses and protects the personal data you submit through our enquiry form, and how to exercise your GDPR rights."
    titleWhite="Privacy"
    titleGold="Policy"
    eyebrow="Legal"
    subtitle="What we collect when you contact us, and what you can ask us to do with it."
>
    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>
        {companyFacts.name} is an aluminium building materials manufacturer based
        in
        {companyFacts.location}. This policy covers the personal data we collect
        through <strong>{Astro.site?.host}</strong> — primarily the enquiry and sample
        request forms on this website.
    </p>

    <h2>Data we collect</h2>
    <p>
        We do not require accounts on this site, and we do not collect payment
        data. The enquiry form asks for:
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li>
            <strong>Name</strong> and <strong>email address</strong> — required, so
            we can reply.
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>Country</strong> — used for shipping, standards and lead-time
            answers.
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>Phone number</strong> — optional; only if you want a call or WhatsApp
            reply.
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>Project details</strong> in the message field — whatever you choose
            to tell us.
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>Sample preference</strong> — an optional checkbox indicating you
            would like sample panels.
        </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
        We also record two technical fields with each submission: the page you
        sent the enquiry from, and the product the enquiry refers to, so the
        right team answers with the right context.
    </p>

    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>
            To answer your enquiry and send quotations, samples or technical
            documents.
        </li>
        <li>To keep a record of conversations we have had with you.</li>
        <li>To understand which product lines buyers ask about most.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
        We do not sell your data, and we do not add you to marketing lists you
        have not asked for.
    </p>

    <h2>Third parties that process data</h2>
    <p>Three services are involved, and they are the only ones:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>
            <strong>web3forms</strong> — form submissions are posted directly to
            <code>api.web3forms.com</code> and delivered to our inbox. They process
            the fields listed above on our behalf.
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>Google Analytics 4</strong> — sets cookies to measure page views,
            scroll depth and outbound link clicks in aggregate.
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>Cloudflare</strong> — hosts and delivers this site and keeps standard
            security and traffic logs (IP address, request metadata).
        </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
        Product images and documents are served from our own Cloudflare R2
        storage, not from a third-party CDN with its own tracking.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
        This site sets only analytics cookies. There is no advertising pixel, no
        cross-site tracking and no cookie wall. If you block cookies in your
        browser, every page on this site still works and the enquiry form still
        submits.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
        If you are in the EEA or UK, you can ask us to access, correct, delete
        or port the personal data we hold about you, or to restrict how we
        process it. You can also withdraw consent at any time without affecting
        processing that already happened.
    </p>
    <p>
        Email us at
        <a href={`mailto:${companyFacts.email}`}>{companyFacts.email}</a>
        and tell us which enquiry your request relates to. We will respond within
        a reasonable period. You also have the right to complain to your local data
        protection authority.
    </p>

    <h2>International transfers</h2>
    <p>
        We are based in China, and our service providers operate globally.
        Sending us an enquiry means your details will be processed outside your
        home country.
    </p>

    <h2>Security</h2>
    <p>
        The site is served only over HTTPS. Enquiry data is limited to what you
        voluntarily send us and is not used for any other purpose.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
        If we change how we handle data, we will update this page. The date
        below shows the last revision.
    </p>

    <p class="doc-updated">
        Last updated: October 2026 · Questions to
        <a href={`mailto:${companyFacts.email}`}>{companyFacts.email}</a>
    </p>
</DocPage>
